OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FA 30-year-old woman who has been
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with a rare and life
OL,8,Fthreatening blood disorder is
OL,9,Fsearching for a stem cell donor for a
OL,10,F"second life."
OL,12,FRafiya Sherin, who is originally from
OL,13,FIndia and now living in Preston, has
OL,14,Frecently been diagnosed with aplastic
OL,15,Fanaemia, a rare disorder in which the
OL,16,Fblood marrow stops making enough new
OL,17,Fblood cells.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
