FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FShe said: "It is when your bone marrow
OL,7,Fhas completely failed. It's an auto-
OL,8,Fimmune disorder because your body
OL,9,Fthinks your bone marrow is a foreign
OL,10,Felement and it's attacking you.
OL,12,F"It was a little overwhelming when I
OL,13,Fgot to hear from the consultant, but
OL,14,Fthen I look back and I have too many
OL,16,Freasons to be grateful for rather than
OL,17,Fcomplaining about it. I still have
OL,18,Fhope in front of me."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FShe is currently receiving two rounds
OL,7,Fof blood transfusions every week, but
OL,8,Fher main hope is to find a stem cell
OL,9,Fdonor. The blood cancer charity DKMS
OL,10,FUK are working with her to find a
OL,11,Fmatch.
OL,13,FRafiya said: "Getting a donor will
OL,14,Fgive me a second life and that's the
OL,15,Fonly hope for me to survive, so I
OL,16,Fdon't have any other options left. As
OL,17,Fsoon as I do the transplant, I can
OL,18,Fsave my life."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FRafiya moved to the UK in 2019 to
OL,7,Fcomplete her master's degree, and went
OL,8,Fon a trip to Serbia to mark her 30th
OL,9,Fbirthday where she became ill.
OL,11,FShe said: "I had food poisoning when I
OL,12,Fwas there, but I wasn't getting better
OL,13,Fwhen I got home, so I went to the GP.
OL,15,F"When I eventually went for the blood
OL,16,Ftest, I got a phone call from the GP
OL,17,Fshortly afterwards telling me to get
OL,18,Fto hospital immediately."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FFor many patients with blood
OL,7,Fdisorders, a stem cell transplant from
OL,8,Fa matching donor could be their only
OL,9,Fopportunity for recovery, but just 7%
OL,10,Fof the eligible population in the UK
OL,11,Fare signed up.
OL,13,FRafiya's ideal donor will be someone
OL,14,Ffrom the South Asian community, a
OL,15,Fgroup that is currently
OL,16,Funderrepresented in the stem cell
OL,17,Fregister.
OL,19,FCurrently, 16% of the UK register is
OL,20,Ffrom an ethnic minority background.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FBronagh Hughes, from DKMS UK, said:
OL,7,F"For Rafiya and for patients like her
OL,8,Faround the country and around the
OL,9,Fworld, the right person signing up to
OL,10,Fthe register could give them their
OL,11,Flife back. And it's so easy.
OL,13,F"All it takes is a few minutes. You
OL,14,Fcan go to our website, we'll send you
OL,15,Fa kit out in the post, and you send it
OL,16,Fback to us for free.
OL,18,F"For someone like Rafiya it could be
OL,19,Fjust the thing they're waiting for."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
