FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786006084
OL,3,CWoman searches for stem cell donor
OL,4,Cafter life-threatening diagnosis
OL,6,FRafiya and her husband, Fawas, have
OL,7,Fset up an event in Preston on 16
OL,8,FAugust to encourage people to be
OL,9,Fswabbed and placed on the donor
OL,10,Fregister.
OL,12,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,13,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,14,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,15,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
